---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Location from './icons/Location.astro';
---

<section
  class="w-full px-3 py-16 sm:py-20 min-h-screen flex items-center snap-start"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-10 sm:gap-12 rounded-[32px] p-8 sm:p-12"
  >
    <div
      class="grid items-center gap-10 sm:gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]"
    >
      <div
        class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end opacity-0 hero-image order-1 lg:order-2"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-64 w-52 sm:h-72 sm:w-60 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-neutral-100 shadow-[0_35px_90px_-70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] dark:bg-neutral-800"
        >
          <Image
            src="https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQEdX6RfYiTHMA/profile-displayphoto-scale_400_400/B4EZojAlzZGUAg-/0/1761523950370?e=1766620800&v=beta&t=xTnRVASZ_LZKifabMZ3YTtk7DnhyTsafBgXk_wspkhE"
            alt="Anderson Marín en blanco y negro"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale transition duration-300 hover:grayscale-0"
            loading="eager"
            width={260}
            height={320}
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="space-y-6 opacity-0 hero-fade text-center lg:text-left order-2 lg:order-1"
      >
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h1
            class="text-4xl sm:text-[46px] lg:text-[54px] font-semibold leading-[1.08] text-neutral-900"
          >
            Anderson Marín
          </h1>
          <p
            class="text-base sm:text-lg font-light text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300"
          >
            Desarrollador de Software · Fullstack
          </p>
          <p
            class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500"
          >
            <Location class="size-4 text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500" />
            Bogotá, Colombia
          </p>
        </div>

        <p
          class="mx-auto lg:mx-0 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 opacity-0 hero-fade-delay dark:text-neutral-300"
        >
          Ingeniero de sistemas enfocado en productos limpios y eficientes. Creo
          experiencias precisas, con código mantenible y decisiones de diseño
          que se sienten sin esfuerzo.
        </p>

        <div
          class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-sm"
        >
          <a
            href="mailto:andersonarturomarin@gmail.com"
            class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-900 px-7 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:bg-neutral-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-white"
          >
            Contactar
          </a>
          <a
            href="/cv.pdf"
            download
            class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 px-7 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:border-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-900 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-100 dark:hover:border-neutral-500"
          >
            Descargar CV
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes heroFade {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .hero-fade {
    animation: heroFade 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }
  .hero-fade-delay {
    animation: heroFade 0.9s ease-out 0.1s forwards;
  }
  .hero-image {
    animation: heroFade 0.9s ease-out 0.2s forwards;
  }
</style>
